It did identify standard mismatches
and ambiguous language.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:44.000
The files-prove-everything claim fails
because records need context and standards.
The files-prove-nothing claim fails
because records can still document facts.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:10:20.000
The safe conclusion is narrower:
the disputed answer was scope-limited,
tied to a reviewed DOJ/FBI file frame,
